5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. It is a pleasure to be in your company. Let us approach this trial with calm hearts and open minds. I look forward to a fruitful discussion as we seek the truth together.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Thank you, Servas. I agree that a calm approach is best. Let's all be honest and observant so we can identify the werewolf efficiently. I'm looking forward to seeing how everyone's logic unfolds.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to play with everyone! I'll do my very best to find the big bad wolf, even if I get a little confused. Let's have lots of fun!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"It's nice to meet you all. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help everyone. Let's try to get along and work together to find the werewolf. I'm looking forward to it!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I agree with the sentiment of remaining calm. Let us observe each other's behavior carefully and rely on logic to uncover the truth. I will do my part.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see such enthusiasm and resolve. In times of uncertainty, the strength of a community lies in its mutual trust. Let us listen closely to one another; the truth often whispers in the quietest moments.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Trust is important, but we must balance it with a healthy amount of skepticism. In a game like this, blind trust can be a liability. I'll be watching for any inconsistencies in our stories.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Skepticism? That sounds like a big word, Mizuki! But I'll be a little detective too! I'll keep my eyes wide open and look for any funny clues. Hehe, the wolf won't be able to hide from me!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I think both trust and caution are important. Mizuki is right that we have to be careful, but let's try to stay kind to each other while we search for the truth. I'll do my best to listen to everyone.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Balance is indeed necessary. While trust facilitates cooperation, logic and evidence are the only reliable tools for identification. I will be analyzing the patterns of our discourse to see who deviates from the truth.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom comes not from the absence of doubt, but from how we navigate it. Let us embrace this journey with grace. I am curious, does anyone have a particular strategy they wish to share?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"My strategy is to focus on the flow of information. I'll be analyzing who is leading the conversation and who is avoiding it. Often, the most cautious players are the ones hiding something.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"My strategy? Hmm... I'll just follow my tummy! If someone feels ""fishy"" or acts super weird, I'll point it out! I'm really good at spotting when people are acting silly or hiding a secret! Hehe!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I don't have a strict strategy like the others, but I'll try to support everyone and keep the atmosphere peaceful. I hope we can all be honest with each other so we can find the werewolf together.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"My strategy is to remain objective. I will prioritize factual consistency over intuition. By comparing the statements made today with the events that unfold tomorrow, I intend to isolate any contradictions that may reveal the werewolf.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a diverse array of perspectives, which is a blessing. Let us carry this spirit of cooperation into the night. May we all find the clarity we seek when the sun rises again.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Let's see what the first night reveals. I'll be paying close attention to the atmosphere tomorrow morning. Good luck to everyone; let's hope the Seer finds a useful lead.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
