35,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. As we begin this new day, let us maintain our composure and share any insights or feelings that have emerged since the sun set.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Good morning. Now that the first night has passed, the Seer should have some information. @Servas, @Sakura, @Midori, @Ryuji—does anyone feel a sudden shift in the atmosphere, or have any leads to share?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Sakura"",""Midori"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Good morning! I slept great! Hmm, let me think... everything feels the same to me, but maybe that's the clue! Does anyone feel super nervous today? I'm watching you all! Hehe!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning, everyone. I'm feeling a bit anxious now that the game has really started, but I don't notice anything strange yet. I'm still listening carefully to see if anyone seems troubled.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The atmosphere remains stable for now. Since the Seer has not yet come forward, we must rely on our own observations. I will continue to analyze the consistency of your statements as we proceed.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is natural to feel anxious, Midori; such feelings often sharpen our intuition. While we wait for the Seer to decide their path, perhaps we should consider how we might best support one another in this search.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Support is fine, but we need a concrete direction. If the Seer is playing cautiously, they might be waiting for someone to slip up. @Ryuji, you mentioned analyzing patterns; have you noticed anything suspicious in our morning greetings?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Ryuji! Yeah, tell us! Did you find any secret clues already? I bet you're thinking really hard with your big brain! Is someone acting fishy? Tell me, tell me! Hehe!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm curious too, @Ryuji. Though I'm sure it's too early for a definite answer, I'd like to hear if anything stood out to you. I just hope we can find the truth without hurting each other's feelings.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mizuki @Sakura @Midori, it is too early to draw a conclusion. The morning greetings are standard. However, the fact that no one has claimed the Seer role yet suggests a cautious approach from that player. I am still observing.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, Ryuji. The Seer may be weighing the risk of exposure against the benefit of guidance. Let us give them space, while we continue to share our thoughts with sincerity and kindness.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Sincerity is a nice sentiment, Servas, but it can be a mask. If the Seer is indeed waiting, we should consider who benefits most from this silence. @Midori, you seem very focused on peace; is that a natural trait or a strategy?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Mizuki, that's a mean question! Midori is just being nice! But... hmm, maybe being *too* nice is a secret trick? Hehe! @Midori, are you hiding a wolfy face behind that smile? Tell us!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki @Sakura, oh my! I'm really not using a strategy, I just genuinely want us all to get along. I'm sorry if it seems suspicious, but I'm just a villager who wants to help.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mizuki @Sakura, focusing on Midori's personality is an intuitive approach, but it lacks empirical evidence. We must be careful not to let bias cloud our judgment. For now, I see no logical reason to suspect her.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us not be too hasty in our judgments. Midori's kindness is a light in this darkness. Perhaps we should focus on the silence of the Seer; who among us is most hesitant to speak?,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"The Seer's silence is indeed the most pressing issue. If the Seer is waiting for a clear target, we should provide one. Since no one has claimed the role, I suspect the werewolf is enjoying the confusion. Let's vote carefully.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, we have to vote already?! I'm not ready! But if we have to, I'll vote for whoever feels the most ""wolfy."" Hmm, maybe someone who's being too quiet? Or too loud? This is so hard! Hehe!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I agree that this is very difficult. Since we don't have any clear clues yet, I'm worried about making a mistake. I'll trust the group's direction, but I hope we can be sure before we decide.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Without a Seer's claim or a clear contradiction, any vote today is a gamble. However, we must act. I will evaluate the voting patterns to see who attempts to manipulate the consensus. Let us proceed to the vote.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
